subtitle: [? if parlament_coalition_policy_effective_cap < parlament_coalition_policy_education_target: This increase will be conditional on a budget with a higher social spending cap being approved by the Parlament.?]
unavailable-subtitle: [? if parlament_coalition_leverage < parlament_coalition_policy_spending_cost: We don't have enough leverage to propose more concessions. ?]
on-arrival: {!
